---
manual: element.flow
lines: [1998, 1998]
testability: api
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  background red
  @row = flow width: 200, height: 50 do
    para "inside"
  end
end
----------- test code
px = ->(x, y) { pixel_at(x.round, y.round).first(3) }

row = layout_of(flow("@row"))

assert_equal [255, 0, 0], px.(row.x + 190, row.y + 45), "the flow paints nothing of its own over what is behind it"
